Explanation of the Logic

1️⃣ Read the Card

string cardSerial = txtCardSerial.Text.Trim();

Example input:

1028


---

2️⃣ Check EmployeeRecord.cs First

empRec.GetEmployeeDetailsByEM(cardSerial);

Possible result:

Card	EmployeeNo	Name

1028	E1028	Juan D Cruz


If found:

strEmpNo = E1028


---

3️⃣ If Not Found → Check Meeting Database

Stored procedure:

MA_CheckEmployeeByCard

This supports old cards or backup records.


---

4️⃣ Tap Mode Decision

Tap IN

Stored procedure:

MA_InsertAttendee

Possible results:

Result	Meaning

0	Already tapped in
1	Successful tap in



---

Tap OUT

Stored procedure:

MA_UpdateAttendeeTimeout

Updates:

TimeOut = GETDATE()


---

5️⃣ Reset the Input Field

txtCardSerial.Text = "";

Cursor returns to the textbox so the next employee can tap immediately.


