RFID Card
   ↓
EmployeeRecord.cs
   ↓
Found?
 ├─ YES → InsertAttendee / UpdateTimeout
 └─ NO  → Check Meeting DB
           ↓
        Found?
        ├─ YES → Continue attendance
        └─ NO  → Card Not Registered


